      "cat-harness:section": "process Process_MaterializeRemote",
      "prov:value": "Each is a decision a person makes and none is answerable from a file, so a gate that only warned would be a gate nobody fails — the xom7 shape, a workflow that failed all thirty times it ran with nothing in the repository saying so.",
